 "Rescue {0} heroes, at least {1} from each layer, to storm it (now {2}: {3} / {4} / {5}).":"营救{0}位英雄，每层至少{1}位，方可强攻（当前{2}：{3} / {4} / {5}）。",
 "J: storm the Crown":"J：强攻王冠",
